v3.5.3

Source:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/argoproj/argo-cd/v3.5.3/manifests/install.yaml

Local changes:
- Use the Redis-maintained GHCR image, pinned to Redis 8.2.10 Alpine.
- Omit Dex resources because this lab uses local Argo CD accounts, not SSO.
- Set memory requests near steady use and limits well above the peak seen
  during a full mission run.
